# Runtime dependencies.
#
# Fork notes:
#   - evdev and pyserial went with the Raspberry Pi hardware support. evdev has
#     no Windows build at all, so keeping it here made `pip install -r` fail
#     outright on Windows.
#   - glfw and PyOpenGL went with the GLFW on-screen display, which mpv's own
#     overlay compositing replaced.
#   - ffmpeg-python went with the switch to a direct ffprobe call that can
#     suppress the console window it pops on Windows.
#   - Pillow, pydantic and psutil are imported directly by our code but used to
#     arrive only as transitive dependencies; pin them explicitly.
